			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766710101,
					"content": "居然還沒到嗎？這下可真是傷腦筋了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710102,
					"content": "怎麼辦，老大！且不說燈塔那邊的兄弟們正等著開工，要是燃料也供給不上，整個營壘怕是都要熄火了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安萊夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710103,
					"content": "是啊，隊長，得趕緊想想辦法啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊捷莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710104,
					"content": "我知道了，你們不用太擔心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710105,
					"content": "先回去自己的崗位上吧，這件事就交給我來處理…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710106,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}、派蒙，是{F#妳}{M#你}們來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710107,
					"content": "你好啊，葉洛亞，大家怎麼都聚在門口？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710108,
						766710109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710108,
					"content": "你看起來好像很忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766710110,
					"content": "沒事，一點小狀況而已，不是什麼大事，我已經在想辦法處理了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710111,
					"content": "葉洛亞每次遇到事情總想著偷偷一個人解決，也說給我們聽聽嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710112,
					"content": "該不會是不好意思說吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710113,
					"content": "哈哈，怎麼會呢？只是這種我自己能解決的事情，就不太想讓大家為此操心了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710114,
					"content": "#不過{F#妳}{M#你}們現在也算是調查分隊「魘夜之鶯」的成員，作為隊長我是不會見外的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710115,
					"content": "這裡說話有些不太方便，我們先進去再慢慢說吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "葉洛亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 766710109,
					"content": "出什麼事了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766710110
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7667102,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7667104
			],
